# Voxula AI website — static build, no server required.
# The on-site "Ask Voxula" chat answers locally from the Docs (src/lib/docsEngine.ts).
# No client-side API key is needed; the Settings preview keeps keys in memory only.
# If you later add a server chat proxy (api/chat.ts), put its key here (never VITE_-prefixed):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
